6476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"110.41\" y1=\"217.29\" x2=\"107.06\" y2=\"221.0\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"102.71\" y1=\"209.59\" x2=\"99.0\" y2=\"212.94\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"95.86\" y1=\"201.13\" x2=\"91.82\" y2=\"204.07\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"94.26\" y1=\"189.5\" x2=\"85.6\" y2=\"194.5\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"84.99\" y1=\"182.3\" x2=\"80.42\" y2=\"184.33\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"81.09\" y1=\"172.14\" x2=\"76.33\" y2=\"173.68\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"78.27\" y1=\"161.62\" x2=\"73.38\" y2=\"162.66\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"76.57\" y1=\"150.87\" x2=\"71.6\" y2=\"151.39\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"81.0\" y1=\"140.0\" x2=\"71.0\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"76.57\" y1=\"129.13\" x2=\"71.6\" y2=\"128.61\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"78.27\" y1=\"118.38\" x2=\"73.38\" y2=\"117.34\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"81.09\" y1=\"107.86\" x2=\"76.33\" y2=\"106.32\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"84.99\" y1=\"97.7\" x2=\"80.42\" y2=\"95.67\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"94.26\" y1=\"90.5\" x2=\"85.6\" y2=\"85.5\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"95.86\" y1=\"78.87\" x2=\"91.82\" y2=\"75.93\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"102.71\" y1=\"70.41\" x2=\"99.0\" y2=\"67.06\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"110.41\" y1=\"62.71\" x2=\"107.06\" y2=\"59.0\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"118.87\" y1=\"55.86\" x2=\"115.93\" y2=\"51.82\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"130.5\" y1=\"54.26\" x2=\"125.5\" y2=\"45.6\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"137.7\" y1=\"44.99\" x2=\"135.67\" y2=\"40.42\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"147.86\" y1=\"41.09\" x2=\"146.32\" y2=\"36.33\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"158.38\" y1=\"38.27\" x2=\"157.34\" y2=\"33.38\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"169.13\" y1=\"36.57\" x2=\"168.61\" y2=\"31.6\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"223.5\" y=\"71.66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">1</text><text x=\"255.34\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">2</text><text x=\"267.0\" y=\"147.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">3</text><text x=\"255.34\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">4</text><text x=\"223.5\" y=\"222.34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">5</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"234.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">6</text><text x=\"136.5\" y=\"222.34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">7</text><text x=\"104.66\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">8</text><text x=\"93.0\" y=\"147.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">9</text><text x=\"104.66\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">10</text><text x=\"136.5\" y=\"71.66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">11</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"60.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">12</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"146.58\" y2=\"179.83\" stroke=\"#8a3e1b\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"246.68\" y2=\"178.50\" stroke=\"#246b9e\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"140\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#193c34\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#193c34\">7時20分</text></svg><figcaption>7時20分鐘面。長而細的藍色分針指向4；短而粗的棕色時針隨分鐘前進，位於7與8之間。鐘面有60個等距分鐘小格。</figcaption></figure><p>上方鐘圖長分針指4，表示20分；短時針在7與8之間，已走過7但還沒到8，所以是7時20分。不能因時針向8靠近就讀成8時20分，也不能把短針硬畫回正對7。</p><p>指圖說「已過7時，這一小時又走20分」。如果不確定，先用整點7時作起點，讓分針走到4，同時讓時針前進一小段。兩根針的移動要配合，不是互不相關的兩個箭頭。</p>",
      "id": "g2s1-mathematics-10-s03"
    },
    {
      "title": "不是整5分，就再數小格",
      "childText": "先找最近前面的5分位置。",
      "html": "<p>分針過數字4後再走3小格，就是20＋3＝23分。若短時針仍在7與8之間，可讀7時23分。先抓20分的基準，再數新增3小格，比從12逐格數到23更容易。</p><p>現在看下圖7時55分：分針指11，短針很接近8但還沒到8，仍讀7時55分。下一個整點才是8時。不要把接近某個數字當成已到那個整點。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 308\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"g2s1-mathematics-10-clock-755\"><title id=\"g2s1-mathematics-10-clock-755\">7時55分鐘面。長而細的藍色分針指向11；短而粗的棕色時針隨分鐘前進，位於7與8之間。鐘面有60個等距分鐘小格。</title><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"140\" r=\"112\" fill=\"#fff7df\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"180.0\" y1=\"41.0\" x2=\"180.0\" y2=\"31.0\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"190.87\" y1=\"36.57\" x2=\"191.39\" y2=\"31.6\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"201.62\" y1=\"38.27\" x2=\"202.66\" y2=\"33.38\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"212.14\" y1=\"41.09\" x2=\"213.68\" y2=\"36.33\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"222.3\" y1=\"44.99\" x2=\"224.33\" y2=\"40.42\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"229.5\" y1=\"54.26\" x2=\"234.5\" y2=\"45.6\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"241.13\" y1=\"55.86\" x2=\"244.07\" y2=\"51.82\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"249.59\" y1=\"62.71\" x2=\"252.94\" y2=\"59.0\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"257.29\" y1=\"70.41\" x2=\"261.0\" y2=\"67.06\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"264.14\" y1=\"78.87\" x2=\"268.18\" y2=\"75.93\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"265.74\" y1=\"90.5\" x2=\"274.4\" y2=\"85.5\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"275.01\" y1=\"97.7\" x2=\"279.58\" y2=\"95.67\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"278.91\" y1=\"107.86\" x2=\"283.67\" y2=\"106.32\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"281.73\" y1=\"118.38\" x2=\"286.62\" y2=\"117.34\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"283.43\" y1=\"129.13\" x2=\"288.4\" y2=\"128.61\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"279.