troke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"137.7\" y1=\"44.99\" x2=\"135.67\" y2=\"40.42\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"147.86\" y1=\"41.09\" x2=\"146.32\" y2=\"36.33\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"158.38\" y1=\"38.27\" x2=\"157.34\" y2=\"33.38\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"169.13\" y1=\"36.57\" x2=\"168.61\" y2=\"31.6\" stroke=\"#526476\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"223.5\" y=\"71.66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">1</text><text x=\"255.34\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">2</text><text x=\"267.0\" y=\"147.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">3</text><text x=\"255.34\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">4</text><text x=\"223.5\" y=\"222.34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">5</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"234.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">6</text><text x=\"136.5\" y=\"222.34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">7</text><text x=\"104.66\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">8</text><text x=\"93.0\" y=\"147.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">9</text><text x=\"104.66\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">10</text><text x=\"136.5\" y=\"71.66\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">11</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"60.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#193c34\">12</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"136.14\" y2=\"167.94\" stroke=\"#8a3e1b\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"141.50\" y2=\"73.32\" stroke=\"#246b9e\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"140\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#193c34\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#193c34\">7時55分</text></svg><figcaption>7時55分鐘面。長而細的藍色分針指向11；短而粗的棕色時針隨分鐘前進，位於7與8之間。鐘面有60個等距分鐘小格。</figcaption></figure>",
